# Caisson Yard (CIPlay caisson_yard): the yard, the foreman's board, crane 2 (by the zipline), the smelter chest, the
# fuel shed, the anchor gear, the trench chart.
island Caisson Yard
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Caisson Yard
zone yard
expect step 1
read Foreman's board
expect step 2
zone crane_2
expect step 3
open Smelter chest
wait 3
expect step 4
open Fuel shed chest
wait 3
expect step 5
open Anchor gear chest
wait 3
expect step 6
read Yard office book
expect step 7
open Lost property box
wait 3
expect story sk_mo 1
expect step 8
read Crane driver's report
expect step 9
read Trench chart
expect step 10
open Crane key box
wait 3
expect story cy_cranekey 1
expect step 11
use cylever
expect story cy_drop 1
expect hidden cycap
expect step 12
air cy_dair
open Yard store chest
wait 3
expect step 13
read Yard pump log
expect done
